treatment offering, bringing a depth of hands-on experience that only comes with decades of dedicated practice. She specialises in facial contouring, skin rejuvenation, and the kind of subtle, long-lasting work that her patients return for year after year.<\/p><p>Her philosophy is simple: the best aesthetic treatment is the one nobody notices.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["image_N4FPWJ","text_MUhDPt","text_PepX9r"]},"group_beWRWq":{"type":"group","name":"t:names.column","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","gap":8,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":10,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"image_4bWdFH":{"type":"image","name":"t:names.image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_0770.heic","link":"","image_ratio":"square","width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_EGXBBM":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.heading","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Alicia Barker<\/strong><\/p><p><em>Superintendent Pharmacist - GPhC 2241860<\/em><\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"h4","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_LUNnqd":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.description","settings":{"text":"<p>Alicia is the clinical backbone of Longeva. As a GPhC-registered pharmacist and Superintendent, she is responsible for the clinical governance, regulatory compliance, and patient safety standards that underpin everything the clinic does, from the treatments offered to the products stocked and the protocols followed.<\/p><p>Her specialist interest in skin health and pharmacology means that every treatment pathway at Longeva is evidence-led and held to the same standard she would apply to her own patients. For Alicia, clinical rigour and a genuine commitment to patient wellbeing are not optional extras; they are the foundation.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["image_4bWdFH","text_EGXBBM","text_LUNnqd"]}},"block_order":["group_6QXy94","gr